"<p>This project has <b>%(fixed)s&nbsp;fixed hours</b> for the "
"month.</p><p>The first <b>%(fixed)s&nbsp;hours</b> recorded are considered "
"fixed hours and <b>do not count</b> toward the FTE execution "
"percentage.</p><p>The execution percentage will start being calculated once "
"those fixed hours have been exceeded.</p>"
